      "problem": "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 10 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n\nI. $A$ has proportional rows\n\nII. $A$ has proportional columns\n\nIII. $A$ has identical rows",
